<% if ci_wheel_only %>
<# Tag-gated to match its only producer. Before the restructure one ungated
   "Conan Build" built every configuration, the wheel included, so an ungated
   Repair Wheel always had something to repair. Now the clean pybind build is
   the only job that emits a wheel and it is `only: tags`, while the branch
   pipeline's instrumented pybind build measures coverage and writes no wheel
   at all. Left ungated this job ran on every branch against an empty
   wheelhouse and failed the pipeline: xmsvtk pipeline 63162,
