      - cov-cpp-summary.json
      - cov-py.xml
      - cov-py-summary.json
      - coverage-status.json
      - coverage-html-cpp/
      - coverage-html-py/

<# Report-only: no conan, no compiler, no gcovr -- it reads the JSON the job
